        "identifier":"urn:wmo:md:int-ecmwf:weather.prediction.forecast.global",
        "title":"ECMWF IFS Global Deterministic Forecast (Destination Earth)",
        "description":"Global deterministic weather forecast from the ECMWF Integrated Forecasting System (IFS), served via the Destination Earth Digital Twin. Provides atmospheric fields including temperature, wind, humidity, pressure, precipitation and cloud cover at multiple levels. Data is accessible via the OGC Environmental Data Retrieval (EDR) API for point, area, trajectory and radius queries, and as rendered map images via the OGC Maps API.",
